# --- repo-audit batch (2026-09-19) — untracked-noise classes, appended (no existing line touched)
# One line each: what it is / why it must not enter the repo.
# JVM crash log: hs_err_pid<PID>.log, written by the JVM itself on a hard crash — state of one
# dead process on one machine, never source.
hs_err_pid*
# JVM crash-replay log: replay_pid<PID>.log, written next to hs_err — same as above, never source.
replay_pid*
# Heap dump: *.hprof (binary, from -XX:+HeapDumpOnOutOfMemoryError / jmap) — a multi-hundred-MB
# memory image of one run, never source.
*.hprof
# Merge / patch residue: *.orig (pre-merge copy) and *.rej (rejected patch hunk) — local conflict
# scratch of a single working copy, never source.
*.orig
*.rej
# Editor residue: *.swp (vim swap) and *~ (auto backup of the previous revision) — machine-local
# editor state, never source.
*.swp
*~
